erved\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n15:T695,\\u003ch1\\u003eCinemaLED Ultra 0.9\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eGet CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 for ultra-fine pitch cinema LED screens in Dubai. Upgrade your theater visuals today with Brightluxx UAE!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e8K MicroLED for the ultimate home cinema experience.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe pinnacle of home cinema technology. CinemaLED Ultra delivers true 8K resolution at 0.9mm pixel pitch using COB MicroLED, offering an unprecedented 33 million pixels for screens 150\\u0026quot; and above. Pixel-level dimming enables infinite contrast in perfectly dark viewing rooms. Integrated Dolby Atmos-synchronized ambient lighting creates a fully immersive cinema atmosphere. Each unit is individually calibrated at the factory for D65 white point accuracy.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat resolution does CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 offer?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCinemaLED Ultra 0.9 delivers true 8K resolution with 7680x4320 pixels, ensuring ultra-high definition visuals ideal for the most demanding home cinema environments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch and why is it important?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe pixel pitch is 0.9mm, which means pixels are placed very closely together. This tight spacing allows for sharp, detailed images that are perfect for close-range viewing in home cinema setups.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow bright is the CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 and does it support HDR?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIt offers 1000 nits brightness with a peak of 2000 nits for HDR content, supporting HDR10+ and Dolby Vision IQ for enhanced contrast and lifelike color accuracy.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003e