": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"0.9mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1000 nits (peak 2000 nits HDR)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Ta1b,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What resolution does CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 offer?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 delivers true 8K resolution with 7680x4320 pixels, ensuring ultra-high definition visuals ideal for the most demanding home cinema environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 0.9mm, which means pixels are placed very closely together. This tight spacing allows for sharp, detailed images that are perfect for close-range viewing in home cinema setups.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 and does it support HDR?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It offers 1000 nits brightness with a peak of 2000 nits for HDR content, supporting HDR10+ and Dolby Vision IQ for enhanced contrast and lifelike color accuracy.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of home cinema environments is this display suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This display is perfect for ultra-luxury home cinemas, superyacht theaters, and VIP screening rooms where immersive, high-end viewing experiences are required.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 compare to traditional projector-based home cinemas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike projectors, CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 provides infinite contrast through pixel-level dimming, 8K native resolution without scaling artifacts, and superior color accuracy, making it ideal for professional-grade home cinema.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are available?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers comprehensive warranty options covering the CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 display, including factory calibration assurance and technical support for installation and maintenance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the display size be customized?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, standard sizes include 150\\\", 180\\\", and 220\\\", but custom sizes can be manufactured to fit unique home cinema architectural requirements.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does the display include any ambient lighting features?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, integrated Dolby Atmos-synchronized ambient lighting enhances the immersive cinema atmosphere by adjusting lighting in sync with the audio environment.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"CinemaLED Ultra 0.9\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/cinemaled-ultra-09\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T695,<h1>CinemaLED Ultra 0.9</h1><p>Get CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 for ultra-fine pitch cinema LED screens in Dubai. Upgrade your theater visuals today with Brightluxx UAE!</p><p><strong>8K MicroLED for the ultimate home cinema experience.</strong></p><p>The pinnacle of home cinema technology. CinemaLED Ultra delivers true 8K resolution at 0.9mm pixel pitch using COB MicroLED, offering an unprecedented 33 million pixels for screens 150&quot; and above. Pixel-level dimming enables infinite contrast in perfectly dark viewing rooms. Integrated Dolby Atmos-synchronized ambient lighting creates a fully immersive cinema atmosphere. Each unit is individually calibrated at the factory for D65 white point accuracy.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What resolution does CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 offer?</h3><p>CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 delivers true 8K resolution with 7680x4320 pixels, ensuring ultra-high definition visuals ideal for the most demanding home cinema environments.</p><h3>What is the pixel pitch and why is it important?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 0.9mm, which means pixels are placed very closely together. This tight spacing allows for sharp, detailed images that are perfect for close-range viewing in home cinema setups.</p><h3>How bright is the CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 and does it support HDR?</h3><p>It offers 1000 nits brightness with a peak of 2000 nits for HDR content, supporting HDR10+ and Dolby Vision IQ for enhanced contrast and lifelike color accuracy.</p><h3>What types of home cinema environments is this display suited for?</h3><p>This display is perfect for ultra-luxury home cinemas, superyacht theaters, and VIP screening rooms where immersive, high-end viewing experiences are required.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\"