illion pixels for screens 150&quot; and above. Pixel-level dimming enables infinite contrast in perfectly dark viewing rooms. Integrated Dolby Atmos-synchronized ambient lighting creates a fully immersive cinema atmosphere. Each unit is individually calibrated at the factory for D65 white point accuracy.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What resolution does CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 offer?</h3><p>CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 delivers true 8K resolution with 7680x4320 pixels, ensuring ultra-high definition visuals ideal for the most demanding home cinema environments.</p><h3>What is the pixel pitch and why is it important?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 0.9mm, which means pixels are placed very closely together. This tight spacing allows for sharp, detailed images that are perfect for close-range viewing in home cinema setups.</p><h3>How bright is the CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 and does it support HDR?</h3><p>It offers 1000 nits brightness with a peak of 2000 nits for HDR content, supporting HDR10+ and Dolby Vision IQ for enhanced contrast and lifelike color accuracy.</p><h3>What types of home cinema environments is this display suited for?</h3><p>This display is perfect for ultra-luxury home cinemas, superyacht theaters, and VIP screening rooms where immersive, high-end viewing experiences are required.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"CinemaLED Ultra 0.9 - Ultra-Fine Pitch LED Cinema Display UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"nam